OL,3,GNEWSAGrandmother drove into nursery and
OL,4,Atrapped boy, 2, under wheels
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grandmother who lost control of her
OL,7,Fcar and smashed it through a nursery
OL,8,Ffence, trapping a two-year-old boy
OL,9,Funder the wheels, has been banned from
OL,10,Fdriving for two years.
OL,12,FJayne James, 63, was dropping her own
OL,13,Fgranddaughter off in the car park of
OL,14,Fthe Partou Sunny Days Nursery in Vale
OL,15,FRoad, Ellesmere Port, when the incident
OL,16,Foccurred on 16 June.
OL,18,FCheshire Police said her grey Omoda
OL,19,Fpeople carrier suddenly accelerated
OL,20,Finto a playground occupied by 22
OL,21,Fchildren aged between two and three.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
